 351: CAPTURE SYSTEM
 352: ==================================================
 353: 
 354: Make capture feel immediate and forgiving.
 355: 
 356: Capture types:
 357: - Note.
 358: - Question.
 359: - Source URL.
 360: - Pasted source text.
 361: - Experiment.
 362: - Task.
 363: - Voice input only if a supported existing capability exists; do not add unsupported voice infrastructure.
