 401: - Expected output types.
 402: - Destination.
 403: - Warning if no API key/model is configured for model-dependent parts.
 404: - Clear statement:
 405:   “SearchGateway performs the web search. Search results are candidates, not verified conclusions.”
 406: 
 407: Results screen:
 408: - Candidate source cards with:
 409:   - Title.
 410:   - Domain.
 411:   - Canonical URL.
 412:   - Snippet.
 413:   - Query.
 414:   - Access time.
 415:   - Relevance rationale.
 416:   - Source kind when identifiable.
 417:   - Credibility signals.
 418:   - Cautions or limitations.
 419:   - Keep, reject, open, extract actions.
 420: - No opaque “credibility score.”
 421: - Use explainable advisory labels:
 422:   - Official documentation.
 423:   - Primary source.
 424:   - Academic / technical paper.
 425:   - Comparable project.
 426:   - Tutorial — verify against stronger source.
 427:   - Limited provenance.
 428:   - Duplicate / overlapping source.
