 738: PREFLIGHT, RECEIPTS, PROVENANCE, AND UNDO
 739: ==================================================
 740: 
 741: All external or agentic work is explicit and reviewable.
 742: 
 743: Preflight bottom sheet:
 744: - Action title.
 745: - Plain-language explanation.
 746: - Exact inputs.
