 772:   - Errors/partial success.
 773:   - Undo availability.
 774: - Receipts must be persistent or safely reconstructable using existing operation records.
 775: - “Open outputs” must take users to the actual cards.
 776: - “Undo” only appears when safe.
 777: - If undo cannot run because output was edited, explain why before attempting destructive work.
 778: 
 779: Provenance card details:
 780: - Creation mode: manual, command, agent, search, extraction.
 781: - Source inputs.
 782: - Search query.
 783: - Source URL.
 784: - Agent profile/model.
 785: - Creation time.
