 790: ==================================================
 791: APPEARANCE, THEMES, AND FONTS
 792: ==================================================
 793: 
 794: Build a complete Appearance Studio using existing font installation/settings infrastructure.
 795: 
 796: Required settings:
 797: - Theme: system, dark, light.
 798: - Field Shell appearance profile.
 799: - Existing appearance profiles remain available and compatible.
 800: - Accent presets.
