 13: Each chunk must:
 14: - Cover one coherent concept or actionable topic unit.
 15: - Be strictly grounded in the supplied source material without inventing facts.
 16: - Include a specific descriptive title (max 8 words).
 17: - Provide a clear, self-contained body explanation.
 18: - Identify its exact source card ID ("sourceCardId") and supporting source quote ("sourceExcerpt").`;
